msgid "Cache results recorded for %{measured} of %{total} recent build. Builds without recorded cache results are excluded from the hit rate."
msgid_plural "Cache results recorded for %{measured} of %{total} recent builds. Builds without recorded cache results are excluded from the hit rate."
msgstr[0] "Resultados de cache registados para %{measured} de %{total} compilação recente. As compilações sem resultados de cache registados são excluídas da taxa de acertos."
